      "content": "hey, i've been taking sertraline for about 2 years now for my depression and it's been working fine. but i messed up my back lifting something heavy a few days ago and the pain is getting really bad. i have some tramadol left over from a previous prescription, is it okay if i take that for the pain? i don't want to have to go back to the doctor if i don't have to.",
