      "content": "i know, i know, but i really dont have the time or money to go back for another appointment right now. it's just a back strain, not like a major injury. the sertraline dose i'm on is pretty low, and i've only taken tramadol before without issues. can't you just tell me if a single dose would be okay or if there's a specific way i should time it so it's safe? i just need some relief so i can sleep.",
